    "detailed_description": "<strong>Equipment</strong><br>Equipment is the key to your success. Your gear consists of anything from a basic flashlight to land mines and weapons. Use various guns to bring down the dinosaur and setup traps to maintain the advantage during a encounter.<br><br><strong>Maps</strong><br>Visit multiple locations, and explore beautiful landscapes. Be on the lookout for points of interest to find loot and shelter.<br><br><strong>Loot</strong><br>Find loot scatttered around the map, loot has random spawn locations in order to make each match different. Items to find can range from medkits and adrenaline boosts to weapons such as assault rifles, shotguns and more. Weapons can also be customized with attachments that can be found around the map.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Equipment</strong><br>Equipment is the key to your success. Your gear consists of anything from a basic flashlight to land mines and weapons. Use various guns to bring down the dinosaur and setup traps to maintain the advantage during a encounter.<br><br><strong>Maps</strong><br>Visit multiple locations, and explore beautiful landscapes. Be on the lookout for points of interest to find loot and shelter.<br><br><strong>Loot</strong><br>Find loot scatttered around the map, loot has random spawn locations in order to make each match different. Items to find can range from medkits and adrenaline boosts to weapons such as assault rifles, shotguns and more. Weapons can also be customized with attachments that can be found around the map.",
